# The composer's keyboard hint and Send label must be TEXT the UI font can
# actually draw. Roboto has no arrows: the hint used to be "<return-arrow> send"
# and the button "Send  <up-arrow>", and both arrows rendered as nothing at all
# — leaving a bare lowercase "send" floating next to the context meter and a
# button with a trailing gap. A missing codepoint draws no tofu, so neither was
# visible in review. afterhours_gaps.md #48.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":760,"open_tabs":["t2"],"active_tab":"t2","theme":"dark"}

expect_text "Send"

click 646 674
wait_frames 4
type "hint check"
wait_frames 6
expect_text "Enter to send"
